<td id="S4.T1.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Reliability, User Impact</td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_r">22.86</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r">transparency</td>
